  offerLine: Is that... no. It can't be. Gran... turned this house upside down... for that. It took her... eleven years.
  activeLine: Take... your time. I would.
  readyLine: She'd want you... to have this. It grew... on her shell, in the end. There's only ever... been the one.
  doneLine: Thank you. From both... of us.
